// variants and the engine then plays the English stream. The engine's language object (exe RVA 0x36b56c0, built by the init at 0x14dc330):
// 27 language entries of 0x68 bytes from its start ([+8] enum, [+0x38] -> the speech archive name, e.g. "polish"), the current language
// per category at +0xcc0 + 4 * category (0 text, 1 / 3 tts, 2 = VOICE: the setter at 0x14dc040 / the resolver 0x14d9df0 check only the
// speech archive for category 2). NULL = English / unknown = no filtering.
