// ---- shop (buy menu inside the backpack's supplements tab)
// The mod's buy menu (winmm) sells, per loadout slot 0..2: ammo for the slot's weapon, or
// for slot 2 (shotgun) the weapon itself until bought. These are its own helpers:
//   0x180018b00(slot) slot in use      0x1800189a0(out, slot) weapon info (below)
//   0x180018f20()     slot-2 owned     0x180019280(slot)      ammo full
//   0x180018ed0(cost) affordable       0x180018e90()          coins
//   0x1800196d0(slot) buy ammo         0x180018fd0()          buy slot-2 weapon
// weapon info: +0 name, +8 icon png, +0x10 weapon id, +0x20 weapon cost, +0x24 ammo cost,
// +0x30 weapon description, +0x38 ammo description.
