    // Still slow -> SP-native speed 1.0 (2.17 s; with the re-timed clips of tools/part1/db_reload.py the gun is shut at
    // ~1.3 s); db_reload_speed() reads t2r-db-reload-speed.txt (e.g. 0.80 = the 2013 2.7 s) over this row's value.
    // Next: normal speed opening, then SLOW DOWN for the entire part where the hand reaches for ammo from the bag, then putting
