// the decision) keeps the rigid attach (armor_wear). Off: t2r-no-armor-rig.txt next to the exe.
// Only twins the loaded DC data has are used (a nonexistent look crashes the spawn /
// Player::ChangeLookId, exe+161de84): each one is looked up with the typed look2 lookup (exe 0x1413578a0,
