// now waits for the victim's MSG_HITREACT2 that the blow landed (reaction / bit1), like the fist punch (melee_hitreact.c mhr_recv); nothing within
// 900 ms = dodged / missed, no cut. t2r-blade-fx-local.txt = at the contact again.
