// the state update (0x140af63a0) pins / re-poses it (+0x1720 override, +0x32 = 1). The pull clip rows (+0x50 / +0x58 of the picked entry) depend only on that entry
// (side) and stance, NOT on the record, and the hand target (vfunc +0x1a0 = 0x140af5830) comes from the entry's own joint sids - so the 'hand grabs air in front of
// the body' clip is the right one for an arrow that sticks OUT of the shoulder; what was seen was the bolt itself missing (invisible). xb_arrow_show: the two
// proven fixes for an invisible fresh object on our own body (hero instance flag as armour on our body uses; the never-drawn draw-control visibility byte +0x48
