// turn (downed-idle^crawl-<45..180>-<l/r>), the downed death (downed-shot^death-<dir> - UC4's downed-kicked^death-<dir>
// is the same animation, so gunfire and melee executions share it; also the bleed-out). The turns' yaw is root
