                // carry: the drawn weapon's layer (log: s_weapon-out, custom-weapon-part, pistol grip; "draw
                // unarmed" returns 0 and the HUD kept the pistol) and the post-anim IK (s_prone-ground-ik, weapon /
                // hand IK) - all built for the stock prone pose, they bend a UC4 lying pose. So while lying: weapon
                // holstered (holster-player-weapon-instantly(0, 0) as the DC scripts call it; unholstering is
