                    // arm up. Fade that layer out while lying, the way the disable does: FindLayer 0x1414447d0(anim
                    // control, sid) + layer fade-out 0x1415f6be0(layer, secs, 1) (sets +0x3d = fading out). Re-checked
                    // every frame: a state change makes a new one.
