        // E must not automatically kick when it cannot execute: the engine's melee commands (melee-attack-shiv in particular is a
        // contextual one) can come on together with the INTERACT press, so an E that execute / revive / the supply box did not take fell through
        // to the downed kick. A melee press that starts within 0.3 s of an interact press is that E: never a kick (E = execute / revive / box only;
        // the kick is the melee button on its own press).
