// the hands are empty / a gun is out, must be switchblade / switchblade-* / knife-survival-mel-player ...), the fist moves need
// abby (or net-is-active + player-base, i.e. every MP player) and the id abby-unarmed. Two halves, BOTH needed:
//   1. IsEllie: player+0x608 = 1 (Player::IsEllie) while the hands are empty (skel_fix, below) and in a window around a swing with a
//      gun out (feature_weapon_skeleton) - the half the first attempt did alone (the swings stayed fists);
//   2. the best-melee weapon is `switchblade` (class 3, a basic melee: durability 0 like abby-unarmed) instead of abby-unarmed:
//      give_hook swaps the spawn kit's abby-unarmed give for it on a female life (female_knife_item() gives it later if the look
