// Mel -> knife-survival-mel-player, Dina -> switchblade-dina-player, all on the switchblade move set): Seraphite (team 0) = Lev's scar
// dagger, WLF (team 1) = Mel's survival knife. which: 0 dagger, 1 survival knife (the net message's byte).
// Pressing F did nothing: the knife id given in place of abby-unarmed left a female life with NO melee
