// Some female models could not melee: 91 'knife swing with a gun out' windows in the reports started 5 swings, and after the
// 'FISTS drawn back' fallback the knife stayed in the inventory (8f580b2e: a knife in the inventory blocks a body's fist melee) - no swing either.
// g_fem_knife_hits = knife-set moves started in this process (female_knife_move_log), g_fem_knife_giveups = lives that fell back to the fists with
// no knife swing, g_fem_gunpress_t60 = the last melee press with a gun out (kwin window), g_fem_strip_at = when the knife is taken out of the
// inventory (female_knife_item). t2r-female-knife-keepinv.txt = the old behaviour (knife stays in the inventory after the fallback).
static int g_fem_knife_hits, g_fem_knife_giveups;
