// Knife swings played Abby's punching audio: the swing's hit sounds follow the character (IsAbby = Abby's unarmed hits,
// wpn-melee-unarmed, in the MP level adds since 3feb42c); winmm forces IsAbby on too, so while the knife is in use the own player answers
// "not Abby" as well (winmm's IsAbby stub for exe 0xDB3300 routed the same way). t2r-knife-keep-abby.txt = IsAbby left to winmm.
static uint8_t (*g_fem_abby_orig)(uint8_t *);
