    // only picks the animation and the shot joint. weapon -> class: pistols / Enforcer / FAR = 1 (small wounds); VEPR, M14, Galil, Taurus
    // revolver = 2 (rifle set: head entry / exit wounds only); hunting rifle, El Diablo, X-caliber, mini-14, Tommy = heavy (class 8; the
    // 4-style head blow-off set stands in because class 8 only has small head wounds); shotguns and the Shorty = 4. A weapon not listed
    // (the victim's record unreadable) falls back to the pair's own class, with a long gun counted as a rifle (2), not heavy.
