// engine's own put-away re-attach of the held weapon was skipped by the sling fix and the draw's attach events were dropped by the holster fix: the crossbow
// was put on the holster point (PutInHolster, instant, not hooked) and never came back to the hand - HUD / item controller said "held", the model stayed on the
// back. (1) the gates are released for 2.5 s from the end of the move (g_xr_free_until, read by hfix_active) so the restore's attach events run; (2) 0.5 s later
// the weapon process's attach point (0x141cd4870) is checked: still on a holster / back point, or not on the hand point it was on when the move began =
