    // being-freed process (the crash fem_pocket_verify still gates behind dbg()). Validated first: readable header, a vtable inside the exe's
    // image, and (when the object carries its handle at +0xc0, as every spawned process does) that handle must resolve back to THIS process.
    // A rejected process answers 0 = "unreadable" (callers treat that as nothing to verify); the first rejections are logged.
