// no native of ours touches processes in those frames - the tick natives are HUD widgets), so this follows the treatment above: a vtable that is not
// a plausible address, or whose first function is not in tlou-ii.exe / t2r-ext.dll / winmm.dll, makes the walker skip that one object (its relocate is
// not run; the entry's own pointer fix-up after the call still does). Hook = 1444fe3 (14 bytes -> jmp + nops). t2r-no-slotdtor-guard.txt = off (shared).
