// The bar as real widgets (mate_hp_widgets.py): per net slot t2rMhT<s> track, t2rMhG/A/R/C<s> fills (green / amber / red / healing
// cyan - no runtime tint exists, so one widget per colour, only the current one shown), t2rMhK<s> the 20 / 40 / 60 / 80 % dividers. Per frame the tag's projected
// position (3840 x 2160 units from the 1280 x 720 box: x from the screen centre, y from the top), size and alpha go to pivotAs / scale / alpha; the fill's x scale
// is size x health fraction (it scales about its top-left corner). A slot whose tag was not drawn this frame is hidden by mhw_sweep() (feature_nametags wrapper), so
// nothing is left behind on death / menus / pause / match end. Pak without the widgets: g_mhw_miss, the old glyph bar below.
