//     the position was fine (only IsFinite(velPs) is checked, not its size). The locomotion update (exe 0x140de35a0) sets that velocity to
//     (new pos - (old pos + [ctrl+0x5c0])) / dt, [ctrl+0x5c0] = this frame's ANIMATION delta in world space, written by the player's
