// ---- HUD shift: everything in the top-left moves down 10 % of the screen height (72 of 720 units, same as
// clan_widgets.HUD_SHIFT_U for the vignette / halo / figures). The radar's blips, pulses and edge pins all derive from the centre
// vector at winmm .rdata 0x1800A79D0 (y, x = 105, 105: lane 0 is the screen y) -> lane 0 += 72. The radar's own disc and player arrow
// glyphs (0x180120357 / 0x18012035a) instead centre on the single float 0x1800A79E8 for BOTH axes (two identical 15-byte runs
// `movss xmm0,[a79e8]; movaps xmm1,xmm0; subss xmm1,xmm3` at 0x18006105B / 0x18006179D, xmm3 = glyph height * k): each is replaced by a
// call to one stub (xmm0 = x as before, xmm1 = (y + 72) - xmm3). Once at load, no per-frame work.
