// Keys: PAIRED-MOVE space = psync's shared ap (x/z ground plane, +y up, the ap quaternion's frame, metres), t = s of move time,
// look = the dof focus point along -Z, fov per key (the hunting-rifle scope close-up is a 70 mm key), roll in degrees
