// clears +0x70 and +0x90, stack 0x2dcb5c8 / 0xbe0681 item controller update). Both come from that one request. The gun stays away
// until the player aims (the unholster writes at 0xbdb53d / 0xbdc6d7 come long after the move). Nothing of ours
// called a holster native (no "holster native:" line). Fix: while one of our paired moves plays (psync / gun execution), phase 1
