        // 1-4 frames later by "victim root: half's layer lost" (phase reads 0.000) - [76635] hold -> [76636] layer lost, our downed body then stands in the base pose): the per-frame
        // teleport-player (engine controller reset) on our own animating body ends the half's animation layer. The travel clamp already stops the body at the obstacle and the pair-end
