    // not part of the move - g_exec_until only counts while our half / the execution timeline still runs)
    if ((cd_free && !att_free) || (psync_role() && g_ps.kind == PS_CTXDOWN)) ctx_mv = 1;
    // (B was punched into a wall, jittered and crashed; B 55065: a duel hit reaction carried us 1.74 m, the wall crossed at 0.45 was
    // taken as "the takedown's own surface", no rewind, the body jittered 1.26 m in / on the wall until an engine assert). A duel reaction on us has no surface
    // of its own either: its crossings are rewound.
    // (live: a duel FINISHER, mf-fist-left-hook-kill, carried the victim 1.33 m through a dirt bank - knee 0.55 chest 0.67, "the takedown's own
    //  surface", no rewind - and the downed body fell 5 m out of bounds. The mf- finishers are open-ground pairs like the duel hits: rewound too.)
